{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the first chapter of an intense top-down shooter/deckbuilder hybrid in Discard All Hope. Explore a rural town and the surrounding countryside while battling  bizarre monstrosities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020390/extras/c87fd1c14ccbf8b3dd7003ee908c794c.avif?t=1758560232\" width=612 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slaughter hordes of enemies in fast paced twin-stick shooter combat! Pull spells from your deck and exploit enemy weakness to generate enough energy to keep up the pace! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020390/extras/280ecceb41825ed73fdc61a3d4a373c9.poster.avif?t=1758560232\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020390/extras/280ecceb41825ed73fdc61a3d4a373c9.webm?t=1758560232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020390/extras/280ecceb41825ed73fdc61a3d4a373c9.mp4?t=1758560232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cancel enemy attacks by interrupting them with their own elements, or overload your foes with arcane energies before detonating. Discard unwanted spells to heal, or equip new ones to pull in nearby powerups. <strong>Discard All Hope</strong> is easy to pick up and play, but offers plenty of mechanics to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020390/extras/1e662584cf969bc9ffb880ebab87657d.poster.avif?t=1758560232\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020390/extras/1e662584cf969bc9ffb880ebab87657d.webm?t=1758560232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020390/extras/1e662584cf969bc9ffb880ebab87657d.mp4?t=1758560232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020390/extras/9eb49b81186d862ce02ff63fc60e6eb9.avif?t=1758560232\" width=612 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hundreds of different spells across 5 elemental types. Blast enemies at range with projectiles, cut through monsters with melee, summon eldritch familiars or protect yourself with defensive wards. Upgrade your favorites and find rare variants with random modifiers and even greater power.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020390/extras/21b815e2723570c61d3234c2d03b9ba5.avif?t=1758560232\" width=612 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through 3 unique areas in this demo, a farm, forest, and town, full of powerful spells to collect and dangerous enemies to fight!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4020390?t=1758560232","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4020390?t=1758560232","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020390/67a87e4df47e65381edeb91dd78e739bce7b5365/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758560232","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020390/67a87e4df47e65381edeb91dd78e739bce7b5365/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758560232","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game de